  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7nr9m0q/Boosted-FPS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"586\" height=\"78\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>以 Fabric 為基礎的模組包，專注於效能優化模組與調整，讓你的 Minecraft 遊戲運行更順暢、更快速！完整支援 Sodium（請參閱下方設定）。此模組包目前支援 Fabric 版本的 1.16.5、1.17.1、1.18.2、1.19.4、1.20.6、1.21 及 26.1。<br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Forge 版本請前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge</a></strong></span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">NeoForge 版本請前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge</a></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Quilt 版本請前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>RPG 版本請前往：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LdG4vgH/Features.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"64\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/675/498/2023-06-10_23.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（透過以下功能，你的原版遊戲體驗將進一步提升）</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最新更新 - 享受搭配最新模組的更新！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FPS 效能提升 - 得益於 Sodium 移植版及其他效能增強模組。此模組包包含了大多數 Fabric 的效能型模組。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組設定 - 在遊戲選單中顯示「模組」按鈕，列出已安裝的模組（也可在此設定模組選項）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">額外的生活品質（QoL）模組，讓你的 Minecraft 遊戲體驗更加愉快。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hypixel 就緒 - 已預載 Hypixel 伺服器，安裝後即可遊玩！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>原版（無模組）FPS：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mFgNnsD/vanilla-screenshot.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Boosted FPS 模組包：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rMZBCHR/boosted-screenshot.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P6pJTy8/Config.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\" height=\"86\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">渲染距離已設定為較低數值（例如 5）以最大化 FPS。可將其提高至 8 或更高以看到更遠距離。你可以在「選項 / 影片設定 / 一般 / 渲染距離」中變更此設定。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FPS 高於螢幕更新率或出現畫面撕裂？請在「選項 / 影片設定 / 一般」中開啟垂直同步。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在影片設定的光影包選項中啟用光影（如果你的系統能夠負擔）。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FAv8Axl7GIo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9mN4mjBuPXA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fYFU4QtCzEw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ge32Bcch5UY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pmiSOeedr3k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3g58tPSTmpQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一同遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
